.TH DANBY-GRANDTOUR 1
.SH NAME
danby-grandtour \- sequential outer-planet gravity assists
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/grandtour
.SH MODEL
Sun, Jupiter, and Saturn move under mutual gravity while a massless spacecraft
is launched outward. Persistent trails and distances to both planets expose
whether initial speed produces one or two useful encounters.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/grandtour.b
